      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DRAGON (1) has been kept up to the mark with a nice trial since he came from a much wider barrier for third at Albion Park last time. That was his fourth placing in five starts since a city win so he is going well. The ace draw gives him every chance to return to the winners' list. UNCLE TONY (3) has been coming from wider barriers at Albion Park of late. A more favourable draw brings him into contention. REAL TIN TIN (7) draws to trail the top pick and could be close to a win after two successive placings here, one of them from this barrier. MARTIN MAGIC (9) cops a tougher draw but was good in a last-start win by 2.5 metres at Marburg.",
